# WARP-8: HOME held, the keys mute (a black key its track, a white key a sound of the kit shown, for every kit: the
# scenes keep the first four kits'); the last white key held is a fill, and a step's chance can be "fill"
wait 300
listen
expect trk 1
press HOME
tapkey b2
release HOME
wait 40
expect mute 4
press HOME
tapkey b2
release HOME
wait 40
expect mute 0
# the sixth kit's first sound: muted, and back
press HOME
turn ALGO 5
release HOME
wait 40
expect trk 6
press HOME
tapkey w0
release HOME
wait 40
expect kmute6 1
press HOME
tapkey w0
release HOME
wait 40
expect kmute6 0
press HOME
turn ALGO -5
release HOME
wait 40
expect trk 1
# a kick on step 1, and one on step 9 that plays only in a fill
tap SEQ
tapkey b0
tapkey w0
tapkey w8
key w8 down
wait 400
turn K3 200
turn K3 -1
wait 40
key w8 up
wait 40
expect drumhits 1
tap PLAY
wait 1500
tap PLAY
expect drumhits 2
press HOME
key w15 down
wait 40
release HOME
said FILL
tap PLAY
wait 1500
tap PLAY
key w15 up
expect drumhits 4
